{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_mc13_l_comb_converted_language_combinations", "label": "The language combinations (reader-facing conversion)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/MC13-L.comb.CONVERTED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The CONVERTED form replaces every internal key citation (L.closed, L.rankpoly, L.void, L.pal, L.chi, L.bits) with a section pointer, so a reader needs no key index \u2014 the conversion is a change of address, not of content."}, {"id": "recovered_mc13_l_comb_converted_p21_admission_test", "label": "P21 admission test for a language combination", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/MC13-L.comb.CONVERTED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A combination must name one shared object of Lambda rather than an analogy between two descriptions. Ten of the C(6,2) = 15 pairs were put to that test and ten hold, each on the same 976 cells."}, {"id": "recovered_mc13_l_comb_converted_divisor_lattice_embedding", "label": "Divisor-lattice embedding: meet and join are gcd and lcm", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/MC13-L.comb.CONVERTED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Under N(x) = prod p_i^{x_i}, coordinatewise meet and join become gcd and lcm with zero failures on either operation over all 475,800 unordered pairs."}, {"id": "recovered_mc13_l_comb_converted_chi_f_one_function", "label": "F and chi are one function written twice", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/MC13-L.comb.CONVERTED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The coefficient function of the rank polynomial F is the membership function chi \u2014 1 when the cell exists, 0 when it does not 